      <bridgehead renderas="sect3">Cosmic-randr Dependencies</bridgehead>
      <bridgehead renderas="sect4">Required</bridgehead>
          <para>rustc, cargo-c, and wayland</para>

    </sect2>

      <sect2 role="installation">
        <title>Installation of Cosmic-randr</title>

    <para>Prepare Cosmic-randr for compilation:</para>

      <para>To Build the Package, issue:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="make">cargo build --release</userinput></screen>

      <para>Now Install the Package, issue:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="install">install -vm755 target/release/cosmic-randr /usr/bin/cosmic-randr</userinput></screen>

      </sect2>

